  "title": "adoption_mode: a declared placement for osf in an org",
  "summary": "Adds a top-level `adoption_mode` key to a repository's `osf.toml`, parsed into an `AdoptionMode` enum with one supported value (`private-factory-repo`). The key is validated on every path that reads the config — the layered `load`, the `--gate` writing check, and the new `require_adoption_mode` helper a command will call to assert the mode it supports — and an unknown or unreadable value stops the command with a message naming the key and the supported values. No command depends on the mode yet; this change only makes the declaration readable and enforceable.",
  "lenses": [
    "architecture",
    "data-flow"
  ],
